3.Which of the following is an advantage of CSS regarding page load speed?

A)It increases the number of images
B)CSS files are cached by the browser, reducing subsequent load times
C)It replaces the need for an internet connection
D)It compresses HTML automatically

✅ Correct Answer: B) CSS files are cached by the browser, reducing subsequent load times

Simple English:

The browser stores (caches) the CSS file after the first visit.

When the user visits the website again:

✅ The browser uses the saved CSS file.
✅ The page loads faster.
✅ Less data is downloaded.
Easy Remember:

CSS Cache = Faster Website

Options:
❌ A) It increases the number of images
✅ B) CSS files are cached by the browser, reducing subsequent load times
❌ C) It replaces the need for an internet connection
❌ D) It compresses HTML automatically

✅ Final Answer: B) CSS files are cached by the browser, reducing subsequent load times


